WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.148 --> 00:00:04.409
"Wow!" said Maggie.

2
00:00:04.829 --> 00:00:08.551
"Look at how many people are at the horse show.

3
00:00:08.571 --> 00:00:19.977
We're going to make tons of Henry laughed.

4
00:00:33.701 --> 00:00:37.603
"Stop counting your future profits and help me hang up our sign."

5
00:00:37.623 --> 00:00:44.106
"Sorry." Maggie held the sign while Henry tacked it to a tree near where they'd set up their

6
00:00:44.146 --> 00:00:44.947
lemonade stand.

7
00:00:45.947 --> 00:00:48.009
Once the sign was hung, Henry wiped his brow.

8
00:00:48.029 --> 00:00:51.731
"Wow, it's pretty hot today."

9
00:00:51.751 --> 00:00:53.351
"I know."

10
00:00:53.732 --> 00:00:54.492
Maggie smiled.

11
00:00:55.312 --> 00:00:57.454
"That should make people buy even more lemonade.

12
00:00:58.734 --> 00:01:01.356
Riding horses in the heat makes you really thirsty.

13
00:01:02.152 --> 00:01:03.413
Trust me, I know!"

14
00:01:04.453 --> 00:01:05.134
Henry nodded.

15
00:01:05.854 --> 00:01:08.215
They were at the stable where Maggie took riding lessons.

16
00:01:09.256 --> 00:01:13.238
Today the stable was putting on a horse show for its students to show off what they'd been

17
00:01:13.278 --> 00:01:14.019
learning all summer.

18
00:01:15.279 --> 00:01:16.520
The stable's owner, Ms.

19
00:01:16.620 --> 00:01:20.522
Wood, had told Maggie that she and her friends could sell lemonade during the show.

20
00:01:21.583 --> 00:01:22.703
A rider hurried over.

21
00:01:22.723 --> 00:01:24.724
"Is the stand open yet?"

22
00:01:24.924 --> 00:01:25.445
she asked.

23
00:01:26.285 --> 00:01:27.486
"I'll take a lemonade, please."

24
00:01:27.506 --> 00:01:29.247
"Coming right up."

25
00:01:29.567 --> 00:01:31.248
Henry poured the girl a cup of lemonade.

26
00:01:32.220 --> 00:01:34.942
As he handed it to her, several more riders came over.

27
00:01:36.023 --> 00:01:40.366
For the next few minutes Henry and Maggie stayed busy serving lemonade to customers.

28
00:01:40.386 --> 00:01:42.267
"Where's Cole?"

29
00:01:42.547 --> 00:01:45.089
Maggie asked as she dropped a quarter into the cashbox.

30
00:01:45.109 --> 00:01:47.071
"We could use his help."

31
00:01:47.091 --> 00:01:51.534
"I think he went to look for more napkins," Henry said.

32
00:01:51.554 --> 00:01:54.035
"I'm not sure why, though.

33
00:01:54.296 --> 00:01:55.917
We already have plenty of them."

34
00:01:57.238 --> 00:01:58.499
A few girls hurried over.

35
00:01:59.279 --> 00:02:02.041
One of them was Daisy, who also rode at Maggie's stable.

36
00:02:02.061 --> 00:02:05.062
"One lemonade, please," a girl said.

37
00:02:05.082 --> 00:02:07.343
"I hope it's nice and cold!"

38
00:02:07.363 --> 00:02:10.884
"It is," Maggie said as she poured the girl a cup.

39
00:02:11.865 --> 00:02:13.786
The girl drank her lemonade quickly and left.

40
00:02:15.646 --> 00:02:20.588
"Some of these riders would be cooler if they took off their long-sleeved jackets," Henry said.

41
00:02:20.608 --> 00:02:23.950
"Those are show coats," Daisy said.

42
00:02:23.970 --> 00:02:27.511
"That's what you're supposed to wear for horse shows."

43
00:02:27.531 --> 00:02:31.765
"Oh. How come you and Maggie aren't wearing them?"

44
00:02:32.065 --> 00:02:32.806
Henry asked.

45
00:02:34.147 --> 00:02:34.907
Maggie frowned.

46
00:02:34.927 --> 00:02:38.409
"I wish I had a show coat to wear," she said.

47
00:02:38.429 --> 00:02:41.371
"But my mom and dad wouldn't buy me one.

48
00:02:42.251 --> 00:02:44.493
And I definitely can't afford to buy one myself.

49
00:02:45.353 --> 00:02:48.295
I barely had enough money to enter two classes in the show!"

50
00:02:48.315 --> 00:02:52.097
"Don't worry, Maggie," Daisy said.

51
00:02:52.117 --> 00:02:56.760
"Ms. Wood said you don't need fancy show clothes, remember?

52
00:02:57.984 --> 00:03:01.087
This show is supposed to be for learning and having fun."

53
00:03:02.368 --> 00:03:03.869
Henry looked at Daisy's T-shirt.

54
00:03:04.950 --> 00:03:07.432
"Are you wearing that bright pink T-shirt in the show?"

55
00:03:07.652 --> 00:03:08.172
he asked.

56
00:03:09.613 --> 00:03:10.594
Daisy shook her head.

57
00:03:10.614 --> 00:03:15.178
"I'm just wearing it in case I get dirty while I get my pony ready.

58
00:03:16.319 --> 00:03:18.861
My new show clothes are hanging by her stall."

59
00:03:20.022 --> 00:03:21.303
"Oh." Henry shrugged.

60
00:03:21.583 --> 00:03:23.304
He didn't know much about horseback riding.

61
00:03:23.325 --> 00:03:25.947
"Well, enjoy your lemonade."

62
00:03:26.287 --> 00:03:27.388
He handed Daisy a cup.

63
00:03:28.492 --> 00:03:31.334
"Thanks." Daisy took a sip, and then walked off.

64
00:03:32.874 --> 00:03:34.455
A moment later Cole rushed over.

65
00:03:35.476 --> 00:03:37.817
His face was sweaty and he was breathing hard.

66
00:03:37.837 --> 00:03:39.858
"Where are the napkins?"

67
00:03:40.198 --> 00:03:40.979
Henry asked him.

68
00:03:40.999 --> 00:03:44.281
"Huh?" Cole looked down at his empty hands.

69
00:03:44.301 --> 00:03:46.882
"Oh. I couldn't find any."

70
00:03:47.242 --> 00:03:48.743
He shrugged and glanced at the table.

71
00:03:48.763 --> 00:03:51.605
"Anyway, it looks like we have enough of them."

72
00:03:52.805 --> 00:03:53.586
Maggie frowned.

73
00:03:53.606 --> 00:03:57.408
"We've been busy, and you missed all the work," she complained.

74
00:03:58.512 --> 00:03:59.253
"Not all of it."

75
00:03:59.513 --> 00:04:01.034
Cole pointed toward some people.

76
00:04:01.054 --> 00:04:03.176
"Here come more customers."

77
00:04:05.498 --> 00:04:08.701
Henry and his friends served several thirsty riders and a few parents.

78
00:04:09.842 --> 00:04:10.963
Then Maggie checked her watch.

79
00:04:10.983 --> 00:04:15.507
"I need to get ready for my first class in the show," she said.

80
00:04:15.527 --> 00:04:18.570
"You guys will be okay without me for a while, right?"

81
00:04:18.590 --> 00:04:21.653
"Sure. Good luck," Henry said.

82
00:04:22.674 --> 00:04:24.996
After she left, a few more customers wandered over.

83
00:04:28.332 --> 00:04:30.794
Then several minutes passed without any customers at all.

84
00:04:30.814 --> 00:04:34.416
"Are you sure you don't want to go to your swim practice?"

85
00:04:34.776 --> 00:04:35.816
Henry asked Cole.

86
00:04:36.837 --> 00:04:40.259
"Maggie and I can probably handle the lemonade stand by ourselves."

87
00:04:40.279 --> 00:04:43.121
"No, that's okay," Cole said.

88
00:04:43.141 --> 00:04:47.303
"The coach said today's practice is mainly for the divers on the team."

89
00:04:48.644 --> 00:04:51.185
He pulled two bright green lollipops out of his pocket.

90
00:04:51.205 --> 00:04:51.946
"Want one?"

91
00:04:51.966 --> 00:04:53.987
"Sure, thanks!"

92
00:04:54.287 --> 00:04:55.628
Henry took one of the lollipops.

93
00:04:56.776 --> 00:04:59.318
"Aren't these the homemade ones from the Dessert Den?"

94
00:04:59.338 --> 00:05:03.240
"Yeah. I bought them when we went there yesterday," Cole said.

95
00:05:03.260 --> 00:05:06.201
"They're kiwi-flavored—my favorite!"

96
00:05:07.422 --> 00:05:08.783
Henry unwrapped his lollipop.

97
00:05:09.743 --> 00:05:12.085
It was sticky and partly melted because of the heat.

98
00:05:12.885 --> 00:05:14.086
But it still tasted good.

99
00:05:15.206 --> 00:05:18.048
After a moment he noticed that Cole's tongue was turning bright green.

100
00:05:18.068 --> 00:05:20.929
"Is my tongue green too?"

101
00:05:21.330 --> 00:05:23.011
Henry asked, sticking out his tongue.

102
00:05:23.971 --> 00:05:24.631
Cole grinned.

103
00:05:24.651 --> 00:05:26.593
"Yeah. You look like a zombie."

104
00:05:26.613 --> 00:05:31.697
"Too bad you don't have any cherry-flavored lollipops," Henry joked.

105
00:05:31.717 --> 00:05:34.760
"Then we could dye our tongues back to red."

106
00:05:35.801 --> 00:05:39.023
Before Cole could answer, Daisy raced up to the lemonade stand.

107
00:05:39.904 --> 00:05:41.085
Maggie was right behind her.

108
00:05:41.105 --> 00:05:44.048
"I need The Lemonade Detectives!"

109
00:05:44.368 --> 00:05:45.229
Daisy blurted out.

110
00:05:45.249 --> 00:05:48.972
"Someone stole my brand-new show shirt!"
